OL,3,A'Everlasting legacy' - Taylor Swift and
OL,4,ABeyonce lead tributes to Dolly Parton
OL,5,Aafter she dies aged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe country icon sold more than 100
OL,8,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,9,Fover 3,000 songs in a career that
OL,10,Fspanned six decades
OL,12,FParton also devoted decades of her life
OL,13,Fto charitable causes, particularly
OL,14,Fchild literacy and education
OL,16,FRaised in poverty in a one-room cabin
OL,17,Fin the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee,
OL,18,FParton was the fourth youngest of 12
OL,19,Fchildren - her early life in pictures
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
